Bytes are Brotli at quality 11, but a number with `~` is under half its limit, and estimated at quality 5, which is about 15% more. The limits: 14.0 kB of HTML, 6.0 kB of CSS, 10 B of JS, 30.0 kB of text fonts, 55.0 kB of math font, 4 requests. An Entry's body isn't part of its Page's HTML.

| Page | HTML | Body | CSS | JS | Text fonts | Math font | Requests |
|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|
| `/about/` | ~67 B |  | 0 B | 48 B, acknowledged | 0 B | 0 B | 1 |
| `/` | ~61 B |  | 0 B | 50 B, over | 0 B | 0 B | 1 |

